===Noun===
{{en-noun}} (abbreviated as ''[[PM]]'')

# An [[investigation]] of a [[corpse]] to determine the cause of [[death]]; an [[autopsy]]
# {{lb|en|figuratively|management}} Any investigation after something considered unsuccessful, especially used of meetings, games and sports, software development, and projects of any kind.

